---
// Wordmark: a stacked-bars glyph (a "narrow stack") plus the name in mono.
---

<a href="/" class="logo" aria-label="Narrowstaq home">
  <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 22 22" aria-hidden="true">
    <rect x="2" y="3" width="18" height="4" rx="1" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.35"></rect>
    <rect x="5" y="9" width="12" height="4" rx="1" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.65"></rect>
    <rect x="8" y="15" width="6" height="4" rx="1" fill="var(--accent)"></rect>
  </svg>
  <span>narrowstaq</span>
</a>

<style>
  .logo {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 16px;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: var(--text);
  }
</style>
